    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The words of Jeremiah the son of Hilkiah, of the priests that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in Anathoth in the land of Benjamin:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To whom the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came in the days of Josiah the son of Amon king of Judah, in the thirteenth year of his reign.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It came also in the days of Jehoiakim the son of Josiah king of Judah, unto the end of the eleventh year of Zedekiah the son of Josiah king of Judah, unto the carrying away of Jerusalem captive in the fifth month.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came unto me, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Before I formed thee in the belly I knew thee; and before thou camest forth out of the womb I sanctified thee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ordained thee a prophet unto the nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said I, Ah, Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! behold, I cannot speak: for I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a child.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ But the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto me, Say not, I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a child: for thou shalt go to all that I shall send thee, and whatsoever I command thee thou shalt speak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not afraid of their faces: for I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with thee to deliver thee, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "put forth his hand, and touched my mouth. And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto me, Behold, I have put my words in thy mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "See, I have this day set thee over the nations and over the kingdoms, to root out, and to pull down, and to destroy, and to throw down, to build, and to plant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Moreover the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came unto me, saying, Jeremiah, what seest thou? And I said, I see a rod of an almond tree.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto me, Thou hast well seen: for I will hasten my word to perform it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came unto me the second time, saying, What seest thou? And I said, I see a seething pot; and the face thereof",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "toward the north.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto me, Out of the north an evil shall break forth upon all the inhabitants of the land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For, lo, I will call all the families of the kingdoms of the north, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.1.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.1.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; and they shall come, and they shall set every one his throne at the entering of the gates of Jerusalem, and against all the walls thereof round about, and against all the cities of Judah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will utter my judgments against them touching all their wickedness, who have forsaken me, and have burned incense unto other gods, and worshipped the works of their own hands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Thou therefore gird up thy loins, and arise, and speak unto them all that I command thee: be not dismayed at their faces, lest I confound thee before them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
